<v Host>The nebuta are big figures made of paper. There are lights inside, so at night they shine brightly.

00:03:24.036 --> 00:03:26.171
<v Vocab>光る

00:03:26.572 --> 00:03:28.348
<v Host>It means to shine.

00:03:28.948 --> 00:03:38.331
