00:04:06.876 --> 00:04:14.627
<v Host>Around the nebuta, many people jump and dance while shouting a festival call. These dancers are called haneto.

00:04:15.228 --> 00:04:17.411
<v Vocab>踊る

00:04:17.812 --> 00:04:19.588
<v Host>It means to dance.

00:04:20.187 --> 00:04:28.827
<v Slow>祭りの衣装を着れば、誰でもハネトになって、祭りに参加できます。

00:04:29.627 --> 00:04:35.315
<v Host>If you wear the festival costume, anyone can become a dancer and join the festival.

00:04:35.915 --> 00:04:38.507
<v Vocab>参加する

00:04:38.908 --> 00:04:42.172
<v Host>It means to participate, or to take part.

00:04:42.771 --> 00:04:59.259
